#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This check box specifies KMouth tries to use the KTTSD speech service "
#| "prior to calling the speech synthesizer directly. The KTTSD speech "
#| "service is a KDE daemon which gives KDE applications a standardized "
#| "interface for speech synthesis and is currently developed in CVS."
msgid ""
"This check box specifies KMouth tries to use the Jovie speech service prior "
"to calling the speech synthesizer directly. The Jovie speech service is a "
"KDE daemon which gives KDE applications a standardized interface for speech "
"synthesis and is currently developed in SVN."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción indica que KMouth tenta utilizar o servizo de voz KTTSD antes de "
"chamar o sintetizador directamente. O servizo de voz KTTSD é un daemon de "
"KDE que fornece aos programas de KDE unha interface normalizada para a "
"síntese de voz e está a ser desenvolvida actualmente no CVS."

